&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task, set priorities and manage time effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to adapt to a changing environment and learn about new financial solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ST1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range represents the low and high end of the anticipated salary range for this position&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The actual base salary offered will depend on numerous factors including the individual’s skills, experience, performance, and the location where work is performed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$20 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;While you make a difference for others, we’ll work to make a difference for you, providing an uplifting, collaborative work environment and benefits that reflect your value to us. For eligible full-time employees, we offer:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
