&lt;li&gt;Re-define and challenge company marketing and acquisition KPIs that are critical to achieving company and business unit goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain automated reporting and dashboards to track key metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the product and operations teams in defining tests and experimental design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
